#: ../../object-types.rst:1
msgid "Declaring object types"
msgstr "声明对象类型"

#: ../../object-types.rst:4
msgid "A project may need names that the standard domains do not know. We declare those object types in TOML. Guidedog can then create targets, index entries, and roles without loading a Python extension. The declaration states a syntax, not executable behavior."
msgstr "项目可能需要标准域不认识的名称。我们在 TOML 中声明这些对象类型，Guidedog 无需加载 Python 扩展就能创建目标、索引条目和角色。声明描述的是语法，而不是可执行的行为。"

#: ../../object-types.rst:8
msgid "Targets: ``add_crossref_type``"
msgstr "目标：\\ ``add_crossref_type``"

#: ../../object-types.rst:18
msgid ""
"``.. setting:: DEBUG`` then makes a target with the id ``setting-DEBUG`` "
"and an index entry, and ``:setting:`DEBUG``` links to it, as in Sphinx. "
"``index`` is Sphinx's ``indextemplate``: its type (``single``, ``pair``, "
"``triple``, ``see``, ``seealso``) before the first colon, and the entry "
"after it, with ``%s`` the name."
msgstr ""
"随后，\\ ``.. setting:: DEBUG`` 创建标识符为 ``setting-DEBUG`` 的目标及索引项，\\ "
"``:setting:`DEBUG``` 则链接至该目标，与 Sphinx 一致。\\ ``index`` 对应 Sphinx 的 "
"``indextemplate``\\ ：首个冒号前是类型（\\ ``single``\\ 、\\ ``pair``\\ 、\\ "
"``triple``\\ 、\\ ``see``\\ 、\\ ``seealso``\\ ），其后是索引项，\\ ``%s`` 代表名称。"

#: ../../object-types.rst:23
msgid "Descriptions: ``add_object_type``"
msgstr "描述：\\ ``add_object_type``"

#: ../../object-types.rst:36
msgid "``.. django-admin:: migrate [app_label]`` then describes the command like any object: a signature, content, an id (``django-admin-migrate``), and an index entry. In Sphinx a ``parse_node`` function may read the signature. Here, fields set its usual work instead:"
msgstr "之后，``.. django-admin:: migrate [app_label]`` 就像其他对象一样描述该命令：签名、内容、ID（``django-admin-migrate``）和索引条目。在 Sphinx 中，可以由 ``parse_node`` 函数读取签名。这里则用字段来完成它通常的工作："

#: ../../object-types.rst:41
msgid "``name``"
msgstr "``name``"

#: ../../object-types.rst:42
msgid ""
"``\"whole\"`` (the default): the object's name is its whole signature. "
"``\"first-word\"``: the name is the signature up to its first space "
"(``pdb``'s ``b(reak) [lineno]`` is named ``b(reak)``)."
msgstr ""
"``\"whole\"``\\ （默认）：对象名是完整签名。\\ ``\"first-word\"``\\ ：对象名为首个空格之前的内容。例如 "
"``pdb`` 的 ``b(reak) [lineno]`` 命名为 ``b(reak)``\\ 。"

#: ../../object-types.rst:46
msgid "``display``"
msgstr "``display``"

#: ../../object-types.rst:47
msgid ""
"How the signature is shown, ``%s`` standing for it. By default, as "
"written."
msgstr "签名的显示方式，\\ ``%s`` 代表签名。默认保留原样。"

#: ../../object-types.rst:49
msgid "``program``"
msgstr "``program``"

#: ../../object-types.rst:50
msgid ""
"``true``: the name becomes the program that options described after it "
"belong to, as ``.. program::`` makes it."
msgstr "``true``\\ ：名称成为后续选项所属的程序，与 ``.. program::`` 相同。"

#: ../../object-types.rst:53
msgid "Other names for directives"
msgstr "指令的其他名称"

#: ../../object-types.rst:56
msgid ""
"An extension may register one of Sphinx's own directives under another "
"name:"
msgstr "扩展可以用另一个名称注册 Sphinx 自有的指令："

#: ../../object-types.rst:64
msgid ""
"A target without a domain is a standard directive, or one of the default "
"domain's; a target such as ``py:function`` names its domain."
msgstr "未指定领域的目标是标准指令，或默认领域的指令；\\ ``py:function`` 这样的目标则明确指定领域。"

#: ../../object-types.rst:67
msgid "Migrating"
msgstr "迁移"

#: ../../object-types.rst:70
msgid "``guidedog migrate`` finds each extension listed in ``conf.py`` that is a module of the project. It reads its ``add_crossref_type``, ``add_object_type``, and ``add_directive`` calls without running them, and writes these tables. It reports what it cannot declare: a ``parse_node`` function (set ``name``, ``display``, and ``program`` to match it) and directives, roles, and event handlers written in Python."
msgstr "``guidedog migrate`` 会找出 ``conf.py`` 中列出的、属于项目自身模块的每个扩展。它读取其中的 ``add_crossref_type``、``add_object_type`` 和 ``add_directive`` 调用（不执行它们），并写出这些表。无法声明的内容会报告出来：``parse_node`` 函数（设置 ``name``、``display`` 和 ``program`` 来对应它），以及用 Python 编写的指令、角色和事件处理器。"
